{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26015","headline":"冬夜荅客 · 鲍溶","name":"冬夜荅客","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"冬日诚可爱，不如夜漏多。\n幸君霜露里，车马犯寒过。\n学耕不逢年，稂莠败黍禾。\n岂唯亲宾散，鸟鼠移巢窠。\n独见青松心，凌霜庇柔萝。\n壮日贱若此，留恩意如何。\n因忆古丈夫，一言重山河。\n临风弹楚劒，爲子奏燕歌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26015.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26015","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}